{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","混沌随现"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","禁锢敌人并将其传送。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","禁锢最靠后的2名敌人，随后将其传送至目标地点落下，并对该地图格范围内的敌人造成200% + 50% ATK伤害并使其倒地，自动战斗时目标地点优先选择最靠前的敌人所在位置。\n被动地，皮帕释放技能时有20%概率造成”失控”，该技能“失控”时，目标会被传送至敌方半场随机位置，包括奇怪的位置！技能施放期间皮帕处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":5,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backest"},{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":153,"end":155,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至250% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至300% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至350% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至400% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","错乱飞弹"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","持续发射魔法飞弹。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","向敌人连续发射9枚魔法飞弹，每枚弹道造成60% + 6% ATK伤害。该技能“失控”时，魔法飞弹将攻击战场上的随机目标，包括自己人！"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","发射魔法飞弹的数量提升至10。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","发射魔法飞弹的数量提升至11。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","发射魔法飞弹的数量提升至12。"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","藤蔓之环"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤魔法植物对敌人造成伤害并吸取能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择敌方最密集的区域生成半径1格的魔法植物持续3秒，持续期间每秒对范围内敌人造成140% + 20% ATK伤害并扣除150点能量。该技能“失控”时，魔法植物只会存在1秒，不好植物枯萎了！"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升急速，多次施法无“失控”后额外提升急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，急速提升10，累计4次释放不“失控”的技能后，急速额外提升5。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，急速提升12，累计4次释放不“失控”的技能后，急速额外提升8。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，急速提升15，累计4次释放不“失控”的技能后，急速额外提升10。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","学有所成"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","皮帕释放技能时，有概率造成“异变”。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","皮帕的每个技能在首次释放时不会“失控”，且每次释放技能有30%概率造成“异变”，“异变”时“混沌随现”、“错乱飞弹”、“藤蔓之环”造成伤害时将对目标周围一格范围内的敌人造成原伤害量80%的真实伤害并使其定身2秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":101,"end":103,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至原伤害量的90%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","累计释放4次终极技能后，皮帕更加自信，施放魔法更加熟练，不再发生\"失控\"，但发生“异变“的概率提高至60%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至原伤害量的100%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","使传送目标在传送门间来回穿梭。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“混沌随现”触发“异变”时，目标区域范围内的敌人将被禁锢，“混沌随现”传送的2名敌人会掉入传送门，保持下落状态持续1.5秒，并在落地时额外受到20%最大生命值的伤害，该伤害不超过自身攻击力400%。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","苍翠之触"]]}